# Phase 4-Re research-experiment-infrastructure: experiment-level data is local-only.
# Sessions are tracked (config snapshot is part of the project), but experiments + replays
# can be huge (per-question jsonl × hundreds of runs).

# Archive — only README.md tracked. Raw runs (working_state, rounds, checkpoints,
# wandb-run-id, etc.) are gitignored.
archive/*/ltm/
archive/*/outputs/*.jsonl
archive/*/outputs/*.json
archive/*/outputs/*.wandb-run-id
archive/*/working_state/
archive/*/*/working_state/
archive/*/rounds/
archive/*/*/rounds/
archive/*/checkpoints/
archive/*/*/checkpoints/
archive/*/*/wandb-run-id.txt
archive/*/*/completed.json
archive/*/*/experiment.json
archive/*/*/summary.json

# outputs/experiments — only REPORT.md (and explicit context md) tracked.
